# T2 — relief: the inter-language agreement
zxapp 1
id relief_t2
matrix 60
name Relief T2
provides within_range truth value lo hi
logic eve within_range <<
eve relief
values = 0 .. 100

within_range {
  value: values 0 .. 100
  lo: values 0 .. 0
  hi: values 100 .. 100
}
.
logic kron within_range <<
(_value>=_lo)&(_value le _hi)
.
check within_range value=0,1,2,3 lo=0,1,2,3 hi=0,1,2,3 = both
